{"id":"CVE-2012-0036","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2012-04-13T20:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T18:09:17.303Z","description":"curl and libcurl 7.2x before 7.24.0 do not properly consider special characters during extraction of a pathname from a URL, which allows remote attackers to conduct data-injection attacks via a crafted URL, as demonstrated by a CRLF injection attack on the (1) IMAP, (2) POP3, or (3) SMTP protocol.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpujul2015-2367936.html","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://h20000.www2.hp.com/bizsupport/TechSupport/Document.jsp?objectID=c03360041","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_HP"],"name":"HPSBMU02786"},{"url":"https://h20566.www2.hpe.com/hpsc/doc/public/display?docLocale=en_US&docId=emr_na-hpesbhf03760en_us","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032924","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_SECTRACK"],"name":"1032924"},{"url":"http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2398","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_DEBIAN"],"name":"DSA-2398"},{"url":"http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201203-02.xml","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_GENTOO"],"name":"GLSA-201203-02"},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/51665","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"51665"},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/48256","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"48256"},{"url":"http://curl.haxx.se/docs/adv_20120124.html","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://curl.haxx.se/curl-url-sanitize.patch","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:058","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_MANDRIVA"],"name":"MDVSA-2012:058"},{"url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=773457","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://support.appl